    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>A 10-foot-wide line runs from your feet along the ground to close range. Each creature in it takes 1d6 force damage per caster level, maximum 10d6; a successful Reflex save negates the damage.</p><p>The wave damages an interposing barrier. If that damage breaks through, the wave continues while range remains; otherwise it stops. It also stops where the ground ends and cannot damage a creature that is not touching the ground.</p><p>The material component is a fragment of shattered rock.</p><p><strong>Automation boundary:</strong> Place the ground line and resolve barrier damage, continuation, ground contact, saves, and damage manually.</p>"
    },
